message: "Please cite this software and the source datasets listed in metadata/sources.json."
type: software
title: "guides: reproducible CRISPRi guide context in K562"
version: 0.2.1
repository-code: "https://github.com/eizorerad/guides"
date-released: 2026-11-11
authors:
  - family-names: Klarov
    given-names: Leonid
    email: leonid.klarov@gmail.com
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A small terminal program that places Dolcetto or user-supplied CRISPRi
  spacers in a human GRCh38 locus and generates a reproducible Quarto report
  of configured windows around annotated transcript starts and K562 DNase,
  histone-mark and CTCF peak overlaps, with ENCODE4 K562 cCRE annotations.
keywords:
  - CRISPRi
  - K562
  - reproducibility
  - genomic annotation
